{"question": "那 CHUNK_SIZE 呢？", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "技术文档里命令块较多时 CHUNK_SIZE 建议怎么调？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "建议适当增大到 800，避免命令被切断。"}], "ground_truth": "CHUNK_SIZE 默认 500 字符；命令块和表格较多时建议增大到 800。", "expected_keywords": ["CHUNK_SIZE", "500", "800"], "expected_sources": ["运维手册.md"], "type": "multiturn-followup"}
